6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BbHoY2Of7cEQ7kNvwGDnuBM&_nc_oc=AdrtrJ-w-5Y86IhkW9nV5-BsyrmHUh5zXhSnnyyup3LersOPohMoyoqCwIeXzegVoBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOBGXvzHso7EhnZC2NLCeD69Wr0Fon4hmBGJcne1lAajg&oe=6ABFBC49"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot_10.png", "id": "981308963494230", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_981308966827563_5041963651491784421_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qoZJZrrAGLEQ7kNvwGDQhVH&_nc_oc=AdqwKFcr6sBE_UVgLY-KZKWlkBAJzlevQ8hz6L9jHZEp9moLnwghLIYS3CVUllWvpJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPZrQro1nK9qd-MvMb1v8yIUzE_G2XFwq3c3f7VNgVCtw&oe=6ABFCF96"}, "display_name": "FingFing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "When you press your finger on the ground, the character moves with a \"Fing\" sound. \nThis is the only control in this game, you don't need a controller, just \"Fing\" the ground with your index finger, and you can clear all the stages of the game. \n\n{469790078996779}\n\nYou can unlock 6 cute characters, and you can choose the main character for each stage. \nYou can play a total of 300 stages. when you clear the last stage, you can watch a concert of the 6 characters. \n\n\"FingFing\" is organized into four categories of games.\n Crossing the road, Find the maze, Block floor, Memorization\n\nImmerse yourself in a casual puzzle game filled with cute spaces and cute characters.  Master the art of finger movement and challenge yourself with increasingly complex levels. \n\n1. Crossing the road\n{468079492518832}\n\n2. Find the maze\n{1746179812456480}\n\n3. Block floor\n{1200729004441377}\n\n4. Memorization\n{1041506847592682}", "short_description": "\"FingFing\" a VR healing puzzle game played entirely with your fingers"}]}, "developer_name": "AroundEffect Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aroundeffect.blogspot.com/2021/07/aroundeffect-privacy-policy.html", "developer_